        "revision": 1345687150,
        "heading": "Toxicity",
        "text": "The oils contained in the oil glands that are found throughout the above ground portions of the plant may cause irritation to the skin and in some cases are said to cause photodermatitis.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
